## Testing with cURL

```bash
# 1. Search users
curl "http://localhost:3000/users/search?q=khalil"

# 2. Send friend request
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/freindship/send-request \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"requesterId":"USER_ID_1","recipientId":"USER_ID_2"}'

# 3. Get friends
curl http://localhost:3000/freindship/friends/USER_ID

# 4. Get pending requests
curl http://localhost:3000/freindship/pending-requests/USER_ID

# 5. Accept request
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/freindship/accept/FRIENDSHIP_ID \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"userId":"USER_ID"}'

# 6. Check status
curl http://localhost:3000/freindship/status/USER_ID_1/USER_ID_2
```

